        {
          "id": "af24177c-ec71-3255-bc3b-6834ee75ffbb",
          "content": {
            "id": "af24177c-ec71-3255-bc3b-6834ee75ffbb",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "How AI is quietly reshaping industrial stocks like C.H. Robinson",
            "description": "<p><strong>Opening Bid Unfiltered is available on </strong><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/opening-bid/id1749109417\"><strong><ins>Apple Podcasts</ins></strong></a><strong>, </strong><a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/6blmkje6G8vLF8cVSWxa5A\"><strong><ins>Spotify</ins></strong></a><strong>, </strong><a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLx28zU8ctIRrPPoWZxI2uK-uEGDIx0DDD&feature=shared\"><strong><ins>YouTube</ins></strong></a><strong>, or wherever you get your podcasts.</strong></p>\n<p>The market loves putting money to work on AI stocks; that much has been made clear in the past two years. The appetite to own AI plays is broadening to more under-the-radar names, including companies that are using the technology aggressively in the industrial sector. Yahoo Finance Executive Editor <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/brian-sozzi/\"><ins>Brian Sozzi</ins></a> sits down on the <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLx28zU8ctIRrPPoWZxI2uK-uEGDIx0DDD\"><ins>Opening Bid Unfiltered</ins></a> podcast with C.H. Robinson (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CHRW\">CHRW</a>) CEO Dave Bozeman. Bozeman has led the 120-year-old logistics player for more than two years, following considerable stints in transportation operations at Amazon, Harley-Davidson, and Caterpillar. Since his arrival, C.H. Robinson has leaned hard into AI to drive improved operating profits. The company has delivered in a big way, sending the stock price up 55% in 2025. Bozeman shares what\u2019s next in the company\u2019s tech-driven overhaul, what the future of freight looks like, and whether the trade war stands to send the US economy into a ditch ultimately.</p>\n<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/6blmkje6G8vLF8cVSWxa5A?si=13c787846e704eaa\"><ins>Listen</ins></a> on your favorite podcast platform or<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/opening-bid/\"> <ins>watch</ins></a> on our website for full episodes of Opening Bid Unfiltered.</p>\n<p><em>Yahoo Finance's Opening Bid Unfiltered is produced by Langston Sessoms.</em></p>",
